WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.069 line:0%
-Guys, I want to play
a new game. "Voice Swap."

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:05.538 line:0%
We're going to do a regular
interview, except, Mila,

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:06.906 line:0%
when I ask you a question,

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:08.741 line:0%
Ashton is going to
answer for you,

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:11.577 line:0%
and you have to move your mouth
so it looks like you're talking.

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:13.078 line:0%
And, Ashton,
when you get a question,

00:00:13.078 --> 00:00:15.248 line:0%
Mila will answer for you, and
you'll have to move your mouth.

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:18.051 line:0%
It's like you guys are
ventriloquists basically.

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:19.585 line:0%
Are you ready to try this?
-Yeah.

00:00:19.585 --> 00:00:21.888
-It's the first time. I
appreciate you guys trying this.

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:24.223
Mila Kunis, how are you doing?

00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:26.226
-Uh -- Uh -- Oh, wait.

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:29.629
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:32.298
-I have to move my mouth.
You have words.

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:34.000
-I got it. I got it.
-Okay.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.468
-I'm great.

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:38.838
I went to the bathroom this
morning and took a giant...

00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:40.106
-Okay.

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:43.008
-And I feel wonderful
after doing that.

00:00:43.008 --> 00:00:46.980
Because I released my entire
innards, and from that,

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:50.850
it just opened me up to the
wonderful energy of the world.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.819
-Oh, my gosh.
Mila, what a great answer.

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:55.121
I didn't think you were
going to get that descriptive.

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:58.725
Ashton Kutcher, same with you.
How are you doing, bud?

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:00.460
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:03.730
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.602
Okay. All right.
Let's get to the question.

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:12.671
