00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:38.330
God, I didn't think
you'd be that into it.

00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:40.233
Ashton very excited.

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:43.102
Mila, have you been having
any quarantine dreams?

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:45.938
Like, what was
your craziest dream?

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:47.273
-Oh, my cra-- Ooh.

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:53.112
-My craziest dream.
Hm. Let me think about it.

00:01:53.112 --> 00:01:55.247
I know exactly what it is.

00:01:55.247 --> 00:01:59.184
One night, I dreamed
that I had elbow cancer.

00:01:59.184 --> 00:02:02.722
I don't even know why I would
dream that I have elbow cancer,

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:06.192
