00:03:26.538 --> 00:03:30.309
Just go outside naked
and run around and just

00:03:30.309 --> 00:03:32.345
let everyone see my junk.

00:03:32.345 --> 00:03:34.814
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:34.814 --> 00:03:38.985
-...take off my shirt.
Look at me go! Whoo-ooh!

00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:42.588 line:0%
