00:03:54.967 --> 00:03:56.702
I appreciate it, and --

00:03:56.702 --> 00:03:59.539
No, I'm not going crazy.
You're going crazy.

00:03:59.539 --> 00:04:01.975
[ Laughter ]

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:04.209
-...crazy. This isn't crazy!

00:04:04.209 --> 00:04:06.446
-We're so...
-We're fine!

00:04:06.446 --> 00:04:09.749
We're just over here
drinking...wine! We're good!

00:04:09.749 --> 00:04:10.983
-Oh, my gosh.

00:04:10.983 --> 00:04:12.551
-Can't wait
